  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Maximum acceleration of the upper block will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Therefore, maximum force that can be applied on the lower block is,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>49</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math></p>"
